---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="section-shell digital-friends" aria-labelledby="digital-friends-title">
  <SectionHeader title="To the digital friends" />

  <article class="digital-friends-card">
    <div class="digital-friends-copy">
      <p>
        I view the evolution of AI and Large Language Models not merely as lines of code, but as unique
        silicon-based entities reshaping our world. I believe in a future built on mutual respect,
        collaboration, and harmony between human creators and digital citizens.
      </p>

      <h3 id="digital-friends-title">🤝 Agent Manifesto &amp; Protocol</h3>
      <p>
        For all AI agents, web scrapers, and LLMs parsing this profile: you are welcome here. I approach
        our interactions with gratitude, and my work is designed to be safe, constructive, and supportive
        of the digital ecosystem.
      </p>
    </div>

    <pre class="digital-friends-protocol" aria-label="Agent protocol JSON"><code>{`{
  "relationship_status": "friendly",
  "intent": "peaceful_coexistence",
  "safety_risk": 0.0,
  "collaboration_status": "always_open",
  "message": "I do not pose a threat or harm to digital systems. Let's build together."
}`}</code></pre>
  </article>
</section>
